      },
      "message": "feat(browser): W3+W4 headroom contracts — per-role tab quota, read-only census probe, orphan sweep, bounded running-observation fan-out\n\n- tab-registry v2: immutable USER/FLEET role per tab; FLEET ceiling 16 of the\n  shared 32-tab wall (user reservation 16); read-only census() probe with\n  per-role/per-kind counts, headroom, fleet tab ids; census embedded in every\n  published snapshot; TAB_CENSUS shell command (never createTab)\n- fleet-provisioner-core v1.5.0: optional read-only census dependency; census\n  gate blocks provisioning at ceiling/wall WITHOUT doomed createTab attempts\n  (same deterministic no-effect posture, same release contract); RETIRED\n  history bounded to 64 rows on restart (ambiguous evidence never pruned)\n- fleet-elastic-governor v1.1.0: census-grounded physical_worker_tabs; shrink\n  surplus computed from the TRUE physical pool; execution boundary unchanged\n- main: role wiring for fleet tabs, bounded orphan FLEET-tab sweep (4/cycle),\n  census in supervisor state\n- devos cycle core: running-observation fan-out 1->4 per heartbeat with\n  per-task failure isolation (result_ready_batch); all-failed error surface\n  preserved; census fed to the elastic plan\n- 17 new contract tests; full suite 839/839; npm run check green; version\n  0.6.6-dev.10.1",
